            "review_text": "avinash a\n4 contributions\n0\nAmazing experience\nFeb 2026 • Family\nStopped by this place while exploring the Son Tra Peninsula and had a pleasant experience overall. It’s in a convenient location and easy to find if you’re staying around the Phuoc My area.\nThe atmosphere was relaxed and comfortable, making it a nice spot to unwind after a day out. Staff were polite and welcoming, which added to the experience.\nFood and drinks were decent and served in good time. Nothing overly fancy, but it does the job well if you’re looking for a simple, enjoyable meal nearby.\nA good option to consider if you’re in the area and want a casual place to eat without any hassle.\nRead more\nWritten February 10, 2026",
